        "created_at": "2024-01-11T19:06:55.833Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They hemmed and hawed about it for a while, but in one of the more recent episodes (some time last year, I think), they came right out and said that Marvel &amp; DC don’t exist there. They said it quickly and off-the-cuff, though, so they may not have meant it literally.</p>",
