        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-01-13T00:55:07.421Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"30444\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A news reporter? I want to see Night Snake kidnap Tabitha Taft and then be like, whoa, hang on, what the heck is going on here, you’re supposed to turn into a <em>snake</em>!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh the number of jokes that can be recycled from Discworld. Like all the “self-inflicted” wounds when some idiots tried to rob a bar when Angua was there…</p>",
