        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"27\" data-topic=\"30444\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Centurion is, of course, the Superman-equivalent of <em>Mutants and Masterminds</em> Earth-Prime setting, published by Green Ronin. <strong>GR Comics</strong> is presumably the comics of the Freedom City setting and its heroes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Which is odd, because the Sentinels of Earth-Prime character cards have the Castle Comics branding.</p>",
